type: software
title: "Positron Confinement Stability in a Penning Trap"
abstract: "Monte Carlo simulation of single-positron confinement stability in an idealised Penning trap at 4 K and 0.1 K, with patch potentials modelled as an Ornstein-Uhlenbeck stochastic transverse field driving E x B guiding-centre transport."
